      "widgets_values": [
        "# \u26a1 ApexForge \u2014 Wan2.1 \u2014 Image to Video\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udfe3 UNETLoader\n**Model:** `wan2.1_i2v_480p_14B_fp16.safetensors`\n\ud83d\udcc1 **Location:** `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/`\n> ~32.8 GB\n\n## \ud83d\udfe3 CLIPLoader\n**Model:** `umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors`\n\ud83d\udcc1 **Location:** `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders/`\n\n## \ud83d\udfe3 VAELoader\n**Model:** `wan_2.1_vae.safetensors`\n\ud83d\udcc1 **Location:** `ComfyUI/models/vae/`\n\n## \ud83d\udfe3 CLIPVisionLoader\n**Model:** `clip_vision_h.safetensors`\n\ud83d\udcc1 **Location:** `ComfyUI/models/clip_vision/`\n\n---\n\n## \ud83e\udde9 Required Custom Nodes\n- None \u2014 all core nodes\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcda ApexForge by Alex Harte\n\ud83c\udf10 **Guides & updates:** https://alexanderharte.com\n\ud83d\ude80 **All models are pre-installed on your pod.**\n\ud83c\udfa8 **Just load this workflow and start generating.**"
